otingWorks to tabulate ballots for all elections. \r\n\t VotingWorks Tabulator Informational Flyer \r\n\t VotingWorks ePollbooks Informational Flyer \r\n City Clerk Office Hours\n\t Address:   58 Opera House Square, \r\n\tClaremont, NH  03743 \r\n\t Phone:  603-542-7003 \r\n\t Fax:  603-542-7038 \r\n\t Email:  centralcollections@claremontnh.com \r\n\t Office Hours:  Monday - Thursday \r\n\t7:00 AM - 4:45 PM \r\n\tClosed on Fridays. \r\n Need to pay a bill?\n\tPaying online is easy!  \r\n\tClick  HERE . \r\n New Voting Equipment Update\n\t\tThe City of Claremont has switched to VotingWorks to tabulate ballots for all elections. \r\n\t VotingWorks Tabulator Informational Flyer \r\n\t VotingWorks ePollbooks Informational Flyer \r\nThe city of Claremont \n                                                58 Opera House Square  \n                                                Claremont NH 03743  \n                                                 603-542-7026 \n                                                 Contact The City \nConnect with Claremont \nCultural Resources \nHistoric District \nEmployment Opportunities \nResident Resources \nGovernment \nDepartments \nHow do I? \nApplications, Forms & Permits \nCodes & Ordinances \nMake A Payment \nGIS Mapping \nResidents \nEconomic Development & Business \nVisitors \nContact Us \nSocial Media Policy \n                                     ADA \nADA COMPLIANCE \nThe City of Claremont has developed this website to be in compliance with Section 508/WC3 to ensure that people using assistive technology can navigate the site. \n©2026 City of Claremont, NH | All Rights Reserved \n                 Tax Calculator \n                     × \n                 Assessed Home Value* \r\n                 City of Claremont Tax Rate \r\n                 $27.80 \r\n                 Per thousand of assessed value \r\n                 Gross Property Tax \r\n                 $0 \r\n*From your City of Claremont 2023 Property Tax bill \r\n         